    {
      "id": "p0075-b002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "English plays a huge part in modern Japanese culture: the Japanese language is filled with English words, English is a mandatory subject in schools, and English has permeated the Japanese entertainment industry for decades. In short, English in Japanese video games is completely normal - and even expected to some degree.",
        "raw": "English plays a huge part in modern Japanese culture: the Japanese\nlanguage is filled with English words, English is a mandatory subject\nin schools, and English has permeated the Japanese entertainment\nindustry for decades. In short, English in Japanese video games is\ncompletely normal - and even expected to some degree.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.12286332,
          0.11773571,
          0.6380458,
          0.19708571
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.12154221,
          0.11702143,
          0.63936691,
          0.19815714
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          2,
          3,
          4,
          5,
          6
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "英语在现代日本文化中举足轻重：日语充满英语借词，学校必修英语，英语也已渗入日本娱乐业数十年。因此，日本游戏中有英语完全正常，某种程度上甚至是理所当然的。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
      },
