    {
      "id": "p0075-b010",
      "kind": "caption",
      "source": {
        "text": "You might be happy to hear that Luigi's Mansion is abbreviated as \"LuiMan\" and that Super Mario Bros. 2 (the Birdo one) is sometimes just called \"USA\" when fans are talking about games in the series",
